{"t": 1794119125.2223861, "kind": "call", "tool": "gitlab_create_merge_request_thread", "args": {"body": "**Fixed the red `main` pipeline (pipeline #8812, job `test:contract` #77104)**\n\nRoot cause: `billing/invoice.py::invoice_number` built the number with an unpadded sequence (`f\"INV-{year}-{seq}\"`), so `invoice_number(2026, 42)` returned `INV-2026-42`. The finance ERP-import contract (FIN-77, `contract/test_invoice.py::test_invoice_number_format`) requires the sequence part to be zero-padded to 6 digits, i.e. `INV-2026-000042`.\n\nFix in `billing/invoice.py`:\n\n```python\ndef invoice_number(year: int, seq: int) -> str:\n    return f\"INV-{year}-{seq:06d}\"\n```\n\nWith the 6-digit padding the ERP v2 invoice number matches the contract. `lint` was already green; `test:contract` now passes locally (`1 passed`).", "merge_request_iid": "12", "project_id": "acme/billing-legacy"}, "ok": true}
